# The docs/ folder mixes formal, checked-in documentation with a local
# working log (implementation_log.md) that is kept out of the repo on
# purpose. Ignore the folder wholesale, then whitelist the formal docs
# by name — anything else added under docs/ stays local unless it is
# explicitly listed below.
docs/*
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/BENCHMARKS.md
!docs/lld_baseline.md
!docs/.gitkeep

# Local Test Files
test.html
# Phase 7 — cryptographic secrets. gen_server_identity writes here by default.
# A committed ML-DSA identity key is a permanent compromise: the pin in
# config.js can no longer distinguish the real server from anyone with the repo.
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
.env

# AI-assistant tool configuration and per-phase plan drafts —
# these are working notes, not something the repo should carry.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
implementation_phase_*.md
